@startuml j4-whatsapp-reminder
title J4 WhatsApp reminder from a customer row
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantFontColor #0B3D2E
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorFontColor #0B3D2E
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  DividerFontColor #0B3D2E
  BoxBorderColor #0E5C45
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner" as Owner
participant "Browser UI\n(index.html)" as UI
participant "app.js" as App
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "WhatsApp / UPI app" as WA
autonumber
== Built at every render, before any tap ==
App -> App : render(): bal = balances()[phone] for each customer
App -> App : reminderText(c, bal)
alt bal above zero
  App -> App : "Namaste {name}, this is a reminder from {shop}.\nYour balance is Rs {amt}. Pay by UPI: {upi link} Thank you."
  App -> App : upiLink(c, bal): upi:~//pay?pa={UPI ID}&am={bal, two decimals}&pn={shop}&cu=INR&tn=Hisaab {name}
  note right of App : UPI ID from Settings (state.upi);\nuntil set, the demo ID hisaab.demo@upi
else bal below zero (advance)
  App -> App : "...You have Rs {amt} in advance with us. Thank you."
else bal is zero
  App -> App : "...Your account is settled, Rs 0 due. Thank you."
end
App -> UI : a[data-remind] href = wa.me/91{phone}?text={encoded message},\ntarget _blank (same link on the customer page as #cust-remind)
opt Settings: owner saves shop name and UPI ID
  Owner -> UI : Shop settings form, Save
  alt UPI ID typed and validUpi() fails
    App -> UI : #settings-msg "Enter a UPI ID like shopname@okbank, or leave it empty."
    note right of App : nothing is saved; empty is allowed\n(the demo ID is then used)
  else valid or empty
    UI -> App : submit: state.shop, state.upi
    App -> LS : save()
    App -> App : render(): every reminder link is rebuilt
  end
end
== The reminder ==
Owner -> UI : tap the WhatsApp button on a customer row
note right of UI : a plain link; no click handler in app.js
UI -> WA : open wa.me in a new tab or the WhatsApp app
WA --> Owner : chat with +91{phone}, message typed in, not sent
Owner -> WA : read it, press Send in WhatsApp
note right of WA : the app never sends by itself
opt customer pays from the UPI link in the message
  WA -> WA : the customer's UPI app opens with payee, amount and note filled
  Owner -> UI : later records the payment (journey J2)
end
opt on the customer page: UPI pay link (#cust-upi), shown when bal above zero
  Owner -> UI : tap UPI pay link
  UI -> WA : open upi:~//pay?... in a UPI app on this phone
end
@enduml
